{"id":"n15727-3-7","stage":2,"title":"묻히다 · 埋","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15727-3-7-1","ko":"언제까지 침대에 묻혀 있을 거야?","zh":"你还要在床上赖到什么时候？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제까지","audio":"/audio/8902d9621c6f3af4db86.mp3"}},{"text":"침대에","meaning":"床，床铺","explanation":"침대：床，床铺；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"침대","audio":"/audio/438637b694f51806c024.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36702","senseId":"1","lemma":"침대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"침대에","audio":"/audio/7fc39f614cffaf7118be.mp3"}},{"text":"묻혀","meaning":"埋，窝","explanation":"묻히다：埋，窝；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"묻히다","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15727","senseId":"3","lemma":"묻히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻혀","audio":"/audio/8c3b9edf0b4a014efd99.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"是……吗？（询问事情或情况）","explanation":"거：某种事情、情况；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"438637b694f51806","term":"침대","zh":"床，床铺","audio":"/audio/438637b694f51806c024.mp3","entryId":"36702","definition":"供人睡卧的家具。","pronunciation":["침ː대"]},{"id":"28120c6c18d8503b","term":"묻히다","zh":"埋，窝","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3","entryId":"15727","definition":"身体深靠在椅子或被子等里面。","pronunciation":["무치다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事情、情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事情、情况","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad9a447dc9b6a6aaba6b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15727-3-7-2","ko":"오늘부터 방학이니까 좀 봐줘요.","zh":"从今天开始就是假期了，就通融一下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘부터","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘부터","audio":"/audio/ae991bcf586a36f3e1a4.mp3"}},{"text":"방학이니까","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방학이니까","audio":"/audio/6410411ab8a4f5e000e1.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"봐줘요.","meaning":"请通融一下、体谅一下","explanation":"봐주다 在这里表示体谅、通融；对方以刚开始放假为由，请家人允许自己赖床一会儿。-어요 为礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"21","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"9","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐줘요","audio":"/audio/337e971f12d67849f7d1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考虑、体谅（봐주다：通融）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"考虑、体谅（봐주다：通融）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"给","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/52138e156c70bb3d050a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.23,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15727","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":68,"sequenceScore":1.7821,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你还要在床上赖到什么时候？","从今天开始就是假期了，就通融一下吧。","为什么要搬家？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你还要在床上赖到什么时候？","从今天开始就是假期了，就通融一下吧。","为什么要搬家？"],"answer":1}]}
